ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080321466111_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080321466111_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/match1944206date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">攻克伯纳乌！拜仁2-1客胜皇马 凯恩迪亚斯建功姆巴佩破门难救主</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260408/zhanbao_image_1944206_1775595016_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260408/zhanbao_image_1944206_1775595016_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260408/zhanbao_image_1944206_1775595016_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>迪亚斯、凯恩破门，阿诺德助攻姆巴佩扳回一球。最终拜仁在客场以2-1击败皇马占得两回合比赛的先机。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/match1944208date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">补时绝杀！阿森纳首回合1-0客胜葡体 哈弗茨替补制胜马丁内利助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260408/zhanbao_image_1944208_1775595235_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260408/zhanbao_image_1944208_1775595235_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260408/zhanbao_image_1944208_1775595235_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>哈弗茨补时绝杀，最终阿森纳1-0击败葡萄牙体育，两队次回合的比赛将于北京时间4月16日凌晨3时移师酋长球场进行。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-07/match1855100date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">U20女足亚洲杯-中国女足U20 1-0泰国小组头名出线 肖亚飞制胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260407/zhanbao_image_1855100_1775574599_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260407/zhanbao_image_1855100_1775574599_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260407/zhanbao_image_1855100_1775574599_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">肖亚飞破门，U20中国女足 1-0泰国女足U20。本场过后，中国女足U20三战全胜排名小组第一出线。</span></p><p><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">【比赛声音/数据】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d567d6e525cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">久违了！拜仁时隔14年再次在欧冠击败皇马，终结8场不胜记录</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251105/690a88dd45bc9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251105/690a88dd45bc9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251105/690a88dd45bc9.jpg"> </div><p>拜仁2-1客胜皇马，终结了对皇马的8场不胜记录。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d576c288d4enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧战积分过线！官方：英超下赛季将有5个欧冠名额</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260223/699b5625568cb.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260223/699b5625568cb.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260223/699b5625568cb.jpg"> </div><p>阿森纳1-0击败葡体。此役后，英超本赛季的欧战积分达到25.013分，已经确定获得下赛季的一个额外欧冠名额。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d5799761d5cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">助人助己！枪手赢球助英超确定5个欧冠名额 同时自己锁定欧冠席位</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d5721929b1enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">40岁功力不减当年！官方：诺伊尔当选皇马vs拜仁全场最佳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080507537341.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080507537341_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080507537341_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，诺伊尔当选欧足联评选的皇马vs拜仁全场最佳。本场，诺伊尔完成9次扑救。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d573177ba95native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">不满！吕迪格：我们两个丢球完全是送礼 对翻盘永远都抱有希望</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.38" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080513173351.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.38" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.38" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080513173351_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080513173351_720.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠1/4决赛首回合，皇马主场1-2不敌拜仁，吕迪格赛后接受了Movistar +的采访。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d577d3c6a87native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">染黄将缺席次回合！琼阿梅尼：我什么都没做就吃到了黄牌</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d57a0d93c2anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿韦洛亚：姆巴佩被铲显然应该是红牌 拜仁在一起磨合的时间更长</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.62" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260408/202604080550482268.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.62" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.62" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260408/202604080550482268.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260408/202604080550482268.jpg"> </div><p><span>皇马主场</span>1-2<span>不敌拜仁。赛后在新闻发布会上，皇马主帅阿韦洛亚表示，下半场如果运气好一些，球队本可以避免这场失利。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d56f13488d8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">未来可期！道曼以16岁97天成欧冠淘汰赛历史最年轻出场球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080456047160.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080456047160_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080456047160_720.jpg"> </div><p>道曼76分钟替补出场，以16岁97天成为欧冠淘汰赛历史最年轻出场球员。</p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d53a2a9a1f7native.htm#pl_box" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">承认误判！官方：马丁蹬踏阿尔马达应被红牌罚下，VAR本不应介入</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.81" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080110208427.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.81" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.81" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080110208427_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260408/202604080110208427_720.jpg"> </div><p>西足协公布上轮西甲判罚评议，承认巴萨后卫马丁在对阵马竞时应该被红牌罚下。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d57375d0ab8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">裁委会承认马丁直红应不变！马竞官方：这个时代承认错误值得称赞</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-07/69d521aca49d5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西媒：巴萨对阵马竞一役裁判组将被处罚，VAR裁判首当其冲遭重罚</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-08/69d27faf9945bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">🕯R.I.P.罗马尼亚名帅卢切斯库因心肌梗塞离世，享年80岁</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d285da0b28e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d285da0b28e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d285da0b28e.jpg"> </div><p>罗马尼亚足协官方确认，前罗马尼亚主帅卢切斯库因病离世，享年80岁。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-07/69d51a12b182dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">镜报：曼城相信他们已在安德森竞争战胜出，有信心6500万镑签下</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241227/676d968dde21b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241227/676d968dde21b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_241227/676d968dde21b.jpg"> </div><p>据《镜报》报道称，曼城相信他们已经在埃利奥特·安德森的竞争战中胜出。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-07/69d51f797fe32native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">利物浦官方：21名球员随队前往巴黎，伊萨克一同出征</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duodu